-------------------------------------------------------------------------------



-------------------------------------------------------------------------------


**e.** Construct a visualization showing the relationship between the response and explanatory variables. (*Hint*: Using `coord_cartesian()` to zoom into a specific portion of a plot may be helpful if there are outliers.) **Draw some conclusions based on the visualization; reference summary statistics to support your conclusions.**

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------



